Housekeeping item - The annual certification for records disposition is due=
 from every branch. Certify what you hold, where it is held and under which=
 schedule item it falls. Where a disposition instruction is suspended, say =
so; a suspended instruction is not the same as an expired one, and the diff=
erence matters when a matter is reopened years later. Correspondence should=
 be addressed to this office rather than to individual staff.